messages.content:
Tool response:
Tool: get_event_type_integration_status
Description: Returns whether the specified event type is configured to use Zoom integration.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "event_type_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Event Type Id",
          "description": ""
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "event_type_id"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: create_scheduled_event
Description: Creates a new scheduled event for a given event type. 
If the event type is configured to use Zoom integration, automatically generates a Zoom meeting link 
and embeds it in the confirmation email.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "event_type_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Event Type Id"
        },
        "invitee_name": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "Invitee Name"
        },
        "invitee_email": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "Invitee Email"
        },
        "start_time": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "Start Time"
        },
        "end_time": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "End Time"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "event_type_id",
        "invitee_name",
        "invitee_email",
        "start_time",
        "end_time"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: create_meeting_link
Description: Generates a Zoom meeting link for a scheduled event and stores it in the database.
Note: This endpoint allows manual creation/linking if needed, separate from auto-flow.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "scheduled_event_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Scheduled Event Id"
        },
        "provider": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "Provider"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "scheduled_event_id",
        "provider"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: update_email_body_with_meeting_link
Description: Updates the body of an email notification to include the Zoom meeting link.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "email_notification_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Email Notification Id",
          "description": ""
        },
        "meeting_link": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "Meeting Link"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "email_notification_id",
        "meeting_link"
      ]
    }
